B.Sm=new A.bV(B.fV,["How long does a smartphone/laptop repair typically take?","Most minor repairs (like display, battery, charging ports) are completed within 2 to 4 hours. Logic board chip-level diagnostics generally take 24 to 48 hours with live status updates at every stage."],t.li)
B.Sq=new A.bV(B.fV,["What is covered under the 180-Day QuickFix Guarantee?","All replacement parts installed by QuickFix carry a 180-day guarantee against manufacturing defects, touch responsiveness issues, or premature degradation. If any defect appears, we repair or replace it at zero cost."],t.li)
B.So=new A.bV(B.fV,["Is doorstep pickup and return delivery really 100% free?","Yes, completely free! There are zero hidden convenience or logistics charges. Even if you choose not to proceed with the repair post-diagnosis, return delivery is free."],t.li)
